# g35-fu-x core wiring

## 1. DesktopResidualService registration (compose_flip.rs real_core)
Place: right after the `MigrateProfileService::new(...)` registration (the line ending `// `migrate/profile/*``), where `directory`
(the SessionDirectory Arc) and `blobs` (the one BlobStore, built in section 3 of the compose) are in scope. If `directory` is built after
that line, put the registration after the line that builds it instead; the order of registrations does not matter.

    builder.register(Arc::new(mixdog_core_domains::domains::desktop_residual::DesktopResidualService::new(
        Arc::new(mixdog_core_session::session::attachments::DesktopAttachmentHost::new(directory.clone(), blobs.clone(), &b.tokens)),
        &b.tokens,
    )))?; // `desktop/link/*`, `desktop/attachment/*`, `desktop/workflowConfig/read`, `desktop/fonts/list`

and REMOVE from SERVICE_PENDING the six names `desktop/link/resolve`, `desktop/link/resolvePath`, `desktop/attachment/resolve`,
`desktop/attachment/stage`, `desktop/workflowConfig/read`, `desktop/fonts/list` (and their comment lines).

## 2. desktopPet/placement/resolve
DesktopPetService (already registered) now also claims `desktopPet/placement/resolve`; it needs the row in pending-rows/g35-fu-x.rows.
Nothing else to wire. SERVICE_PENDING does not list it.
